  <abstract format="text/plain" language="en" script="Latn">The ultimate objective of this Recommendation is to enhance the sustainability of identified priority sectors in smart cities, in order to optimise economic, environmental and social benefits.Cities will decide on their digital transformation priorities. For example, cities might also want to encourage collaboration to deliver desired outcomes. This kind of engagement based on the assessment framework can incentivize industry engagement and investment.Recommendation ITU-T Y.4906 contains the following:</abstract>
